---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<Layout>
  <article class="policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the directory</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="policy-date">Updated 6 October 2026</p>
    <p>BeanFinder is a curated guide to Australian coffee roasters and multi-roaster sellers. Use it to discover businesses and plan visits.</p>
    <h2>Check before visiting or buying</h2>
    <p>Listings combine historical information, operator sources and community suggestions. Addresses, cafe access, ratings, opening hours, services and website links can change. A listing or map marker does not guarantee that a business is open to the public or endorse a particular product. Check current details directly with the business before travelling or ordering.</p>
    <h2>Google Maps</h2>
    <p>Google Maps supplies maps, location search and current place information. Your use of these features is subject to the <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms">Google Terms of Service</a> and the <a href="https://www.google.com/help/terms_maps/">Google Maps/Google Earth Additional Terms of Service</a>. Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">privacy policy</a> applies to these services. Attribution shown with maps and place information identifies the provider.</p>
    <h2>Community contributions</h2>
    <p>Submit information you believe is accurate and are entitled to share. Names, websites, listing fields and explanatory notes may be published in GitHub review requests, edit receipts and the directory. Keep personal information out of those fields. Suggestions are reviewed and may be edited, declined or removed.</p>
    <h2>External websites</h2>
    <p>Roasters, sellers and other linked services operate independently of BeanFinder. Their own terms apply to purchases, subscriptions and services arranged with them.</p>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We may update listings, features and these terms as the site develops. Read our <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a> for information about data handling. Report mistakes through the <a href="/submit/">correction form</a> or <a href="mailto:hello@xandersalathe.com">email BeanFinder</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
